Let score be 0.

Ask "What is capital of France?" and call the answer answer1.
If answer1 is "Paris", say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
If answer1 is not "Paris", say "Wrong. Right answer is Paris".

Ask "What is capital of Japan?" and call the answer answer2.
If answer2 is "Tokyo", say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
If answer2 is not "Tokyo", say "Wrong. Right answer is Tokyo".

Ask "What is capital of Kenya?" and call the answer answer3.
If answer3 is "Nairobi", say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
If answer3 is not "Nairobi", say "Wrong. Right answer is Nairobi".

Ask "What is capital of Canada?" and call the answer answer4.
If answer4 is "Ottawa", say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
If answer4 is not "Ottawa", say "Wrong. Right answer is Ottawa".

Ask "What is capital of Brazil?" and call the answer answer5.
If answer5 is "Brasilia", say "Right" and set score to score plus 1.
If answer5 is not "Brasilia", say "Wrong. Right answer is Brasilia".

Say "Your score is " plus score plus " from 5".
If score is 4 or more, say "Well done!".
